# {{title}}

A counter with a button. It is the smallest app that still has a toolbar, a native control and a test, so it is where you start breaking things.

It is a [NativeDesktop](https://github.com/FormalSnake/nativedesktop) app. One Rust view tree renders through the platform backend: AppKit draws the toolbar and the button on macOS, and the framework draws them elsewhere once those backends ship.

```
┌──────────────┐  ops   ┌──────────────┐
│  src/app.rs  │ ─────> │   backend    │
│  Counter     │ <───── │  NSButton    │
└──────────────┘ events └──────────────┘
```

