## Features

- Counts clicks, 42 of them if you start it with `{{env}}_DEMO=1`.
- One test per tier it can use today: `tests/app.rs` runs the view without a window.
- `nd check` and `nd test` work out of the box, so an agent has something to run on the first try.

Status: first scaffold. The Linux and Windows backends are not shipped, so `cargo run` on those targets returns `no platform backend is linked for this target`.

