`Cmd` on macOS.

## Development

```sh
cargo run       # open the window
nd check        # fmt, clippy, framework lints
nd test         # tiers 1 and 2, parallel
nd test --tier real   # tier 3, needs a window server
```

`src/app.rs` is the view, `src/demo.rs` is the fixed state for tests and screenshots, `build.rs` links the Swift side on macOS. `CLAUDE.md` has the rules for agents working here.

